kage contains applications that are built on tools\n    in the LSC Algorithm Library.\n  homepage: https://wiki.ligo.org/Computing/LALSuite\n  repository: https://git.ligo.org/lscsoft/lalsuite.git\n  documentation: https://lscsoft.docs.ligo.org/lalsuite/\n  license: GPL-3.0-or-later\n  license_file: COPYING\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - duncanmmacleod\n    - skymoo\n",
